{"Title":"Order relative to authorizing the joint committee on Municipalities and Regional Government to make an investigation and study of certain current Senate documents relative to commission membership, animal health inspections, and in-person quorums \r\n ","BillNumber":"S2828","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J10","Name":"Joint Committee on Municipalities and Regional Government","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10","ResponseDate":"2024-06-14T14:26:04.58"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2828/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Order","Pinslip":"Senate, June 17, 2024 -- The committee on Municipalities and Regional Government, to whom was referred the petitions (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1283) of Cynthia Stone Creem (by vote of the town) for legislation to exempt the town of Brookline from in-person quorums; (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1311) of Mark C. Montigny for legislation relative to updating animal health inspections; and (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2467) of Julian Cyr and Dylan A. Fernandes (by vote of the town) for legislation to change the name and membership of the Nantucket Planning and Economic Development Commission, report the accompanying Order  (Senate, No. 2828).","DocumentText":"\tOrdered, That the committee on Municipalities and Regional Government be authorized and directed to make an investigation and study of certain current Senate documents numbered 1283, 1311, and 2467 relative to Municipal matters: commission membership, animal health inspections, and in-person quorums .\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Study","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J10","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Discharge to Another Committee","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}